  "body": "v1.12.4\r\nDependencies\r\n- npm audit goes from 23 vulnerabilities, 1 critical, to 0: the MCP SDK,\r\n  react-router-dom, vitest and esbuild move to patched releases and the\r\n  rest refresh within their ranges. Contributed by @DalenW (#446)\r\n\r\nInternal\r\n- Three GUI tests waited on one thing and read another, which the\r\n  Playwright 1.64 update exposed; they now wait for what they read\r\n  (SY3AFQ2, #447)",
